@ Index:  Non-linear best fit
@ Author: Jaco Mostert
@ Tested: Sample (1,2) (2,4) (3,6) (4,8) returns x-hat at y=0 of 0.
@ Input:  Stat sample (1,2) (2,4) (3,6) (4,8)
@ Output: x-hat at y=0 = 0
@
@ Fit the current statistical sample with every regression family
@ except the straight line, with estimated x.
LBL ‘POL’
  BestF 510         ; all families except LinF
  L.R.
  0.                ; y value for the estimate
  𝑥̂
  END
.END.
